SUMMARY:Tech Champions 5
DESCRIPTION:The 5th edition of the program consists of two startup incubators in the sector of Financial Solution Technologies that utilize AI. The program targets innovative entrepreneurs with digital business and scalable models. The program participants will be provided with the necessary tools and support in the technical\, administrative\, and financial aspects\, in addition to supporting digital perks\, with the aim of contributing to reaching the market and investors.
